nts’ Major Programme(s) and other Minor Programme(s) respectively\n\n can be used to fulfill the requirement of this Minor Programme.</span></p> </td> </tr>\n<tr> <td style=\"width:32.05pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\" valign=\"top\" width=\"43\"> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:.1pt;layout-grid-mode:char\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">[a]</span></p> </td> <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"width:439.45pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\" valign=\"top\" width=\"586\"> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:.1pt;text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph;layout-grid-mode:char\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Students\n\n who have prior knowledge of Hong Kong Sign Language before admission may\n\n be exempted from taking HKSL1000, 1002, 1003, 2001, 2002 and 2003. They\n\n should seek the advice of the Department to take substitute courses in\n\n accordance with their academic qualifications.</span></p> </td> </tr></table>",
